   The shipped jetty.xml with its HTTPS connector uncommented. OpenNMS keeps the
   whole connector inside one XML comment, so there is no property that turns it
   on. The shipped block holds no nested comment, so the first closing delimiter
   after it ends it. The marker tells the guard in tasks/00-web-guards.yml that
   this role owns the file. #}
{{ _opennms_jetty_pristine_content
   | regex_replace('(<!-- Add HTTPS support) -->\s*\n\s*<!--\n([\s\S]*?)\n\s*-->\n', '\\1: ' ~ _opennms_jetty_managed_marker ~ ' -->\n\\2\n')
   | trim }}
